msgid "Admin configuration"
msgstr "Halduri häälestamine"

msgid "An alternate solution is to copy the text in the box above and paste it into the file \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (Warning : database.inc.php must only contain what is in the textarea, no line return or space character)"
msgstr "Alternatiivne viis lahendada, on kopeerida üleval pool kastis oleva teksti faili \"local/config/database.inc.php\" (NB! fail peab sisaldama vaid selle teksti, ei midagi muud ega ühtki tühikutki)"

msgid "Basic configuration"
msgstr "Põhiline häälestamine"

msgid "Can't connect to server"
msgstr "Ühendumine serveriga nurjus"

msgid "Congratulations, Piwigo installation is completed"
msgstr "Palju õnne! Piwigo paigaldamine on valmis."

msgid "Connection to server succeed, but it was impossible to connect to database"
msgstr "Serveriga ühendati ära, aga andmebaasiga ühendumine nurjus."

msgid "Creation of config file local/config/database.inc.php failed."
msgstr "Häälestusfaili loomine ebaõnnestus (\"local/config/database.inc.php\")."

msgid "Database configuration"
msgstr "Andmebaasi häälestamine"

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "Andmebaasi nimi"

msgid "Database table prefix"
msgstr "Andmebaasi tabelinimede eesliide"

msgid "Default gallery language"
msgstr "Gallerii vaikimisi keel"

msgid "Download the config file"
msgstr "Laadi häälestusfail alla"

msgid "Hope to see you back soon."
msgstr "Loodame sind varsti jälle näha."

msgid "Host"
msgstr "Host"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Paigaldamine"

msgid "It appears your webhost is currently running PHP %s."
msgstr "Paistab, et su serveris jooksutatakse PHP versiooni %s."

msgid "It will be shown to the visitors. It is necessary for website administration"
msgstr "Seda näidetakse külastajatele ning on vajalik veebilehe haldamiseks"

msgid "Just another Piwigo gallery"
msgstr "Lihtsalt veel üks järjekordne Piwigo gallerii"

msgid "Keep it confidential, it enables you to access administration panel"
msgstr "Hoia seda salaja, sellega saad lehekülje haldurisse sisse"

msgid "PHP 5 is required"
msgstr "Vajatakse PHP versiooni 5.2"

msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Vabandust!"

msgid "Start Install"
msgstr "Alusta paigaldamist"

msgid "Try to configure PHP 5"
msgstr "Proovi häälestada PHP 5.2"

msgid "User"
msgstr "Kasutaja"

msgid "Welcome to my photo gallery"
msgstr "Tere tulemast mu fotogalleriisse"

msgid "Welcome to your new installation of Piwigo!"
msgstr "Tere tulemast äsja installitud Piwigosse!"

msgid "You can download the config file and upload it to local/config directory of your installation."
msgstr "Sa võid laadida häälestusfaili alla ja ise paigaldada selle oma \"local/config\" kaustasse."

msgid "You may referer to your hosting provider's support and see how you could switch to PHP 5 by yourself."
msgstr "Sa peaksid küsima oma veebimajutuse teenusepakkuja käest, kas on võimalik minna üle PHP versioonile 5.2"

msgid "Don't hesitate to consult our forums for any help : %s"
msgstr "Muidugi kasuta meie foorumeid abi leidmiseks: %s"

msgid "Need help ? Ask your question on <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo message board</a>."
msgstr "Vajad abi? Küsi <a href=\"%s\">Piwigo abilauast</a>."

msgid "Note you can change your configuration by yourself and restart Piwigo after that."
msgstr "Sa võid teha muudatusi seadistusfailis ja pärast ümberkäivitada Piwigo."

msgid "Piwigo may try to switch your configuration to PHP 5 by creating or modifying a .htaccess file."
msgstr "Piwigo oskab ise proovida seadistada PHP 5.2, seadistades selleks .htaccess faili."

msgid "Piwigo was not able to configure PHP 5."
msgstr "Piwigo ei suutnud seadistada PHP 5.2 kasutamist."

msgid "Visitors will be able to contact site administrator with this mail"
msgstr "Külalised võivad kasutada seda epost-aadressi et ühendust võtta administraatoriga"

msgid "also given by your host provider"
msgstr "samuti antud veebimajutuse teenusepakkuja poolt"

msgid "database tables names will be prefixed with it (enables you to manage better your tables)"
msgstr "andmebaasi tabelite nimed alustatakse selle eesliitega (see hõlpsustab tabelite korraspidamist samas andmebaasis)"

msgid "enter a login for webmaster"
msgstr "sisesta veebimeistri jaoks kasutajanimi"

msgid "please enter your password again"
msgstr "palun sisesta parool uuesti"

msgid "user login given by your host provider"
msgstr "veebimajutuse kasutajanimi"

msgid "user password given by your host provider"
msgstr "veebimajutuse parool"

msgid "verification"
msgstr "kinnitamine"

msgid "webmaster login can't contain characters ' or \""
msgstr "veebimeistri kasutajanimi ei saa sisaldada jutumärke"

msgid "localhost or other, supplied by your host provider"
msgstr "localhost või teised, antud teenusepakkuja poolt"

msgid "PHP version %s required (you are running on PHP %s)"
msgstr "Vajalik on PHP versioon %s (Teil on kasutusel PHP %s)"

